 \section{Fusion Mechanisms and Attribution}
-Uniform fusion averages the two calibrated branch probabilities. F2 fits an unweighted L2 logistic model to those probabilities, with $C=1$ and a new intercept and two coefficients. It is neither an F-beta metric nor a convex weighted average. Its coefficients depend on score scaling and are not causal percentages of modality importance.
